WEBVTT

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:57.320
Hilander72
Ripped by

00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:18.320
So, at last he's come...
Dark Schneider!

00:01:19.070 --> 00:01:22.980
Lady Nei, you really
intend to fight him?

00:01:24.950 --> 00:01:28.050
To fight Lord Dark Schneider?!

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:33.740
Anyone who interferes with the
realizing of my ideal world...

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:36.090
...even if it's Dark Schneider...

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:39.450
...must die!

00:01:41.570 --> 00:01:44.980
This reaction... It comes!

00:01:45.010 --> 00:01:47.800
The dragon who
strikes with thunder...

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:50.800
...to cleanse away
cursed blood with blood...

00:01:50.850 --> 00:01:52.080
It comes!

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:57.870
Day Boom Stain!
Spirits of earth and air!

00:01:59.170 --> 00:02:02.750
Honor the ancient pact and
fulfill your duty to me!

00:02:03.440 --> 00:02:04.850
MEGA D'SU!

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:20.090
That was close.
We got out by a hair!

00:02:21.550 --> 00:02:22.480
Arshes?!

00:02:31.770 --> 00:02:35.710
What's wrong, Arshes? Why do
you have vengeance in your eyes?

00:02:36.260 --> 00:02:41.050
<i>That woman is Arshes Nei...</i>
<i>Dark Schneider's lover?</i>

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:45.720
<i>With another woman again?</i>

00:02:46.780 --> 00:02:50.530
<i>Nothing's changed a
bit since the old days.</i>

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:53.500
<i>You'd come back after playing</i>
<i>with some strange woman somewhere...</i>

00:02:53.530 --> 00:02:55.070
<i>...and I'd always</i>
<i>be waiting for you.</i>

00:02:59.930 --> 00:03:02.990
<i>You carry the</i>
<i>accursed fingernail.</i>

00:03:03.020 --> 00:03:07.510
<i>If your heart turns</i>
<i>towards Dark Schneider...</i>

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:12.920
<i>...your flesh will crumble</i>
<i>away and you will be left to...</i>

00:03:12.950 --> 00:03:15.900
<i>...live forever as</i>
<i>a pathetic toad.</i>

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:18.190
<i>Even if you come back to life...</i>

00:03:18.220 --> 00:03:20.850
<i>...in the end you only cause</i>
<i>me grief, Dark Schneider.</i>

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:23.370
<i>But today that ends.</i>

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:28.410
Because I swear
that I will kill you!

00:03:29.240 --> 00:03:30.760
Dark Schneider!

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:33.820
Isn't there some way
to avoid this battle?

00:03:35.810 --> 00:03:40.130
No, don't! If you go,
you'll be killed!

00:03:41.140 --> 00:03:46.080
<i>Rushe, there's a chance</i>
<i>you may not come back alive.</i>

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:50.480
<i>There's a chance you might...</i>

00:03:51.670 --> 00:03:55.690
<i>No... I... I!</i>

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:58.150
Yoko.

00:04:00.060 --> 00:04:01.590
Lend me 500 yen, would you?

00:04:02.290 --> 00:04:04.260
Huh? Oh, sure...

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:11.500
I'll give it back later.

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:20.760
You leave me no choice!
You two, hurry up and hide!

00:04:24.150 --> 00:04:28.130
Dark Schneider! As I promised,
I've come for your life!

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:32.700
Arshes! Ungrateful daughter!
I'll teach you a lesson!

00:04:34.890 --> 00:04:36.560
Wa-Quo!

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:42.110
That's a high
mobility flight spell!

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:43.940
RAVEN!

00:04:49.290 --> 00:04:53.410
No, you don't!
Ji Elio Phil Are!

00:04:53.570 --> 00:04:55.450
I call forth the
mysterious symbol...

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:57.590
...which has been passed
down from ancient times!

00:04:58.350 --> 00:05:00.030
What's that spell?!

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:03.080
I'll show you that there
are still some spells...

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:05.630
...in High Ancient that you
don't know! Now take this!

00:05:05.660 --> 00:05:07.000
DAF RAY-BURN!

00:05:09.610 --> 00:05:11.140
Impossible! This is?!

00:05:12.320 --> 00:05:15.490
That lightning ball is sucking
all the magical energy...

00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:18.670
...within its circumference
into a bottomless subspace warp!

00:05:18.910 --> 00:05:22.380
Now your special magical
attacks are useless!

00:05:22.410 --> 00:05:25.260
What did you say?!
H- Huh?! I'm falling?!

00:05:36.990 --> 00:05:41.220
Without your magic, you are no
match for the Thunder God Sword.

00:05:42.640 --> 00:05:44.630
Ow...

00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:47.120
Now to finish you! Die!

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:51.350
Take this!
Dragon Deathstrike!

00:05:58.320 --> 00:05:59.440
What's that?!

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:12.300
Lord Dark Schneider,
my master...

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:18.030
Have you forgotten that you
possess the enchanted Fire Sword?

00:06:18.930 --> 00:06:20.250
Y- You!

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:24.340
To serve and protect its
master is a sword's duty.

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:27.140
If the legendary Thunder God
Sword is now your enemy...

00:06:27.170 --> 00:06:31.210
...then I, Efreet, shall become
the Fire Sword and fight it!

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:42.810
You're an incredibly pushy
elemental, you know that?

00:06:44.690 --> 00:06:48.680
I never expected you
to have the Fire Sword.

00:06:48.710 --> 00:06:50.700
Impressive as always,
Dark Schneider.

00:06:50.730 --> 00:06:53.620
So, you've managed
to tame Efreet.

00:06:53.650 --> 00:06:58.010
However, I'll show you that
even Efreet is no match...

00:06:58.040 --> 00:07:02.170
...for the Thunder Beast, Nue, who
lives inside the Thunder God Sword!

00:07:05.840 --> 00:07:07.130
<i>My heart's pounding.</i>

00:07:07.480 --> 00:07:11.160
<i>I have a really bad feeling</i>
<i>about all this. Rushe...</i>

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:24.550
The secret art! The ultimate
imperial sword thunderstrike!

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:25.940
Eagle claw slash!

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:32.520
I win, Dark Schneider!

00:07:32.940 --> 00:07:34.130
Arshe...

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:37.640
Dark Schneider,
you who are both...

00:07:37.670 --> 00:07:40.210
...calculating and rash,
cold and gentle!

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:45.080
My great master, the only man
on Earth who ever defeated me.

00:07:45.180 --> 00:07:45.950
What?!

00:07:46.550 --> 00:07:49.730
Perhaps you may
not realize it yourself...

00:07:49.760 --> 00:07:52.880
...but the world needs you now!

00:07:54.360 --> 00:07:55.700
Farewell!

00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:57.420
Hey, wait!

00:08:04.770 --> 00:08:06.320
Im- Impossible...

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:12.450
<i>You stupid ape! Who asked</i>
<i>you to butt in like that?!</i>

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:20.710
Forgetting to fight
in the middle of a battle?

00:08:22.320 --> 00:08:25.440
You never used
to be so stupid!

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:39.350
<i>I won...</i>
<i>I've killed Dark Schneider!</i>

00:08:42.820 --> 00:08:43.920
<i>Dark Schneider!</i>

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:46.650
<i>It's all right. You can't die.</i>

00:08:47.090 --> 00:08:48.760
<i>Isn't that right, Rushe?</i>

00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:52.530
<i>Rushe!</i>

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:57.430
Impossible!

00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:02.030
I won't forgive you!
You aren't my daughter anymore!

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:03.430
I'll kill you as my enemy!

00:09:06.340 --> 00:09:09.380
What do you mean, "daughter"?
Don't make me laugh.

00:09:10.140 --> 00:09:14.660
I've never thought
of you as my father...

00:09:15.460 --> 00:09:16.780
...even once!

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:18.720
Very well!

00:09:19.710 --> 00:09:20.750
Raven!

00:09:24.640 --> 00:09:26.840
Boo-ray Boorayn Dead...

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:29.780
Obey your blood oath, come
forth from the land of Abadon!

00:09:30.510 --> 00:09:33.970
You think your special fire attack
will defeat the Thunder Empress?

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:36.230
Don't insult me, Dark Schneider!

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:38.580
Boo-ray Boorayn Dead...

00:09:38.580 --> 00:09:41.330
Obey your blood oath, come
forth from the land of Abadon!

00:09:41.770 --> 00:09:46.170
Fire of Gehena, become a fiery
blast and burn everything around us!

00:09:47.160 --> 00:09:48.670
EXODUS!!!

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:52.870
Rushe!

00:10:07.190 --> 00:10:07.970
Arshe...

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:09.830
DIE!!!

00:10:17.990 --> 00:10:18.740
<i>Arshes...</i>

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:26.920
You fool! Never let
compassion cloud your heart...

00:10:26.950 --> 00:10:29.620
...for even an instant in
a life or death battle!

00:10:30.910 --> 00:10:33.590
Were you really Dark Schneider?!

00:10:39.710 --> 00:10:41.430
Dark Schneider...

00:10:41.850 --> 00:10:43.320
Princess Sheela!

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:46.580
<i>It's okay.</i>
<i>It has to be. Because...</i>

00:10:46.690 --> 00:10:49.800
<i>Because he borrowed</i>
<i>500 yen from me.</i>

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:55.410
<i>I've taught Rushe to pay back</i>
<i>money ever since he was little...</i>

00:10:56.790 --> 00:11:00.220
<i>Rushe, please... GETUP!!!</i>

00:11:03.440 --> 00:11:04.230
What?!

00:11:06.400 --> 00:11:11.380
Our hero, the magnificently
handsome Dark Schneider...

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:14.210
...as unkillable as steel,
whose greatness causes...

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:17.390
...mighty volcanoes to erupt and
lightning to crash in the sky...

00:11:17.420 --> 00:11:18.510
...is BACK!

00:11:18.510 --> 00:11:19.760
Dark Schneider!

00:11:20.390 --> 00:11:22.010
<i>Man, he's stubborn!</i>

00:11:22.040 --> 00:11:25.320
Hmpf! The ugly and powerless
majority of people...

00:11:26.310 --> 00:11:30.520
...and the dazzlingly handsome
hero who was chosen by God!

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:35.100
Dark Schneider is on a whole
other scale! Another scale!

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:43.620
<i>That idiot! He's playing tough</i>
<i>after he's taken some real damage!</i>

00:11:47.230 --> 00:11:49.330
You are incredibly hard to kill.

00:11:49.360 --> 00:11:52.220
But now it ends.
You have no power left...

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:54.640
...to fight the way you have been.

00:11:55.100 --> 00:11:56.810
This time I'll kill you.

00:11:57.220 --> 00:12:01.090
So that we can make real the
ideal world we're fighting for!

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:04.560
Forget it.
You couldn't kill me.

00:12:05.420 --> 00:12:09.960
WHAT?! I'll prove whether
or not I can kill you!

00:12:10.820 --> 00:12:12.550
Arshes! I love you.

00:12:23.250 --> 00:12:28.600
Shut up! I may be a woman, but the
love you inspire in all the others...

00:12:28.630 --> 00:12:30.100
...I don't want!

00:12:33.170 --> 00:12:34.490
You can't escape!

00:12:36.680 --> 00:12:40.330
And just what is this " ideal
world" you're trying to create?

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:44.640
I'd understand a stiff
like Kall saying that...

00:12:44.670 --> 00:12:48.870
...but why do you need that
phrase to conquer the world?

00:12:51.110 --> 00:12:53.670
It will be a utopia
controlled by magical power!

00:12:53.700 --> 00:12:55.090
The Sorcerors' Kingdom!

00:12:55.340 --> 00:12:57.690
There will be no
discrimination, poverty, or war!

00:12:58.060 --> 00:13:01.710
It's worth dying for the dream
of creating a kingdom like that!

00:13:01.740 --> 00:13:07.070
It's a lie! Fighting and
hatred are part of human nature!

00:13:07.360 --> 00:13:11.030
You think you can really create
eternal peace in this world?!

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:15.470
Shut up! How can a vulgar
bastard like you understand?!

00:13:16.450 --> 00:13:19.360
A half elf like me, who's lived
among the wreckage of war...

00:13:19.390 --> 00:13:22.260
...could never be close
with either humans or elves!

00:13:22.290 --> 00:13:26.120
As long as you live, you can
never understand how that feels!

00:13:27.610 --> 00:13:29.890
Since the time I was little,
there hasn't been a day...

00:13:29.920 --> 00:13:31.820
...my body wasn't
covered with fresh bruises!

00:13:32.470 --> 00:13:34.650
And then came that day,
the day of the war...

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:36.510
...between my tribe
and the Wood Elves.

00:13:36.940 --> 00:13:40.000
I was abandoned
by the tribe of...

00:13:40.030 --> 00:13:42.820
...Dark Elves who
had been caring for me.

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:46.660
Good riddance
to a nuisance.

00:13:47.370 --> 00:13:48.440
Arshes...

00:13:49.480 --> 00:13:52.710
The memories of hunger and grief
from that day taught me something...

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:56.580
That all children need
a safe place to live!

00:13:57.190 --> 00:13:59.870
That's all the
reason behind my ideals!

00:14:00.890 --> 00:14:03.830
And now, Darsh... DIE!!!

00:14:08.170 --> 00:14:10.230
Arshe... Have you forgotten?

00:14:10.500 --> 00:14:14.180
I was passing by on the road,
and you grabbed the hem of my robe.

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:16.550
And the 100 years after that?

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:21.740
Didn't I give you
that safe place to live?

00:14:22.520 --> 00:14:23.680
Darsh...

00:14:24.220 --> 00:14:27.730
Think back, Arshes... To that time
when I raised you as my own child.

00:14:28.280 --> 00:14:30.370
<i>There hasn't been a
day in the last 15 years...</i>

00:14:30.400 --> 00:14:32.150
<i>...when I didn't think about it.</i>

00:14:32.610 --> 00:14:35.770
<i>Because, for me,</i>
<i>those 100 years...</i>

00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:41.420
<i>...were the only</i>
<i>memories of paradise I have.</i>

00:14:43.090 --> 00:14:47.140
<i>Perhaps you only did it</i>
<i>on a whim, but for me...</i>

00:14:47.470 --> 00:14:48.470
Arshe...

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:58.110
Arshe!

00:15:09.370 --> 00:15:10.580
Arshe!

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:23.620
Just as I expected.

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:29.680
Look, Kall-Su! Arshes Nei's
nail has turned purple!

00:15:29.710 --> 00:15:31.750
It seems that damned half elf...

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:34.350
...can't tear her heart
away from Dark Schneider.

00:15:36.690 --> 00:15:38.880
This should be very amusing now.

00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:43.220
The more she opens her heart to
Dark Schneider, the fingernail...

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:47.710
...of the Accused spell implanted
within her will bind her body!

00:15:47.740 --> 00:15:51.400
And finally, when that
nail glows crimson...

00:15:51.430 --> 00:15:54.290
When she has completely
turned against us...

00:15:54.320 --> 00:15:57.280
...Arshes Nei's body will shatter!

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:03.690
Kall-Su...

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:06.240
Aren't you going to watch?

00:16:06.660 --> 00:16:09.560
I don't have to. If Nei dies...

00:16:09.590 --> 00:16:15.430
...either you or I will kill Dark
Schneider eventually. Until then...

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:19.350
...I'll be commanding the first army.

00:16:35.990 --> 00:16:39.500
<i>You aren't my daughter anymore!</i>

00:16:43.420 --> 00:16:48.010
<i>You'd always say that</i>
<i>when we'd have a fight.</i>

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:49.890
<i>"You're not my daughter."</i>

00:16:50.750 --> 00:16:52.500
<i>"I love you"</i>
<i>was a killer phrase...</i>

00:16:53.220 --> 00:16:57.010
<i>It would stop any fight</i>
<i>we were having cold.</i>

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:02.640
Arshes... Enough already...

00:17:02.650 --> 00:17:05.150
<i>Darsh...</i>
<i>Perhaps to you I was just...</i>

00:17:05.180 --> 00:17:08.870
<i>...the rare half elf that you raised</i>
<i>as a daughter as a whim, but...</i>

00:17:08.900 --> 00:17:10.570
I'll kill you, just as you wish!

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:13.040
<i>But do you realize that you...</i>

00:17:13.070 --> 00:17:15.870
<i>...were the most important</i>
<i>thing in my life?</i>

00:17:15.900 --> 00:17:19.900
If you were just dead, we could
destroy this kingdom instantly!

00:17:19.930 --> 00:17:23.290
<i>It wasn't just a matter of you</i>
<i>being my father or my lover...</i>

00:17:23.730 --> 00:17:26.210
<i>You were the only thing I had.</i>

00:17:26.830 --> 00:17:30.730
I don't accept surrender from
anyone who crosses swords with me!

00:17:31.030 --> 00:17:32.570
All who lose to me die!

00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:37.970
<i>You were everything that</i>
<i>I could possibly love.</i>

00:17:38.650 --> 00:17:40.830
<i>Please! Don't get up!</i>

00:17:45.530 --> 00:17:46.880
<i>Why?</i>

00:17:49.490 --> 00:17:51.360
<i>Why did you stand up?</i>

00:17:53.620 --> 00:17:54.600
<i>Darsh...</i>

00:17:59.460 --> 00:18:01.310
<i>That's strange... That woman...</i>

00:18:01.740 --> 00:18:05.090
<i>I haven't sensed any evil</i>
<i>intent from her at all.</i>

00:18:05.120 --> 00:18:07.680
<i>It's... It's almost like...</i>

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:10.450
<i>A crying child...</i>

00:18:11.410 --> 00:18:12.380
<i>Darsh...</i>

00:18:13.070 --> 00:18:14.130
Darsh!

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:24.850
Yoko!

00:18:28.480 --> 00:18:31.480
Y- YOKO!

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:34.650
<i>Darsh...</i>

00:18:45.900 --> 00:18:49.510
Jeez, you gotta be careful!
I'm a flower who's barely in bloom!

00:18:50.300 --> 00:18:52.290
Princess Sheela! Princess Sheela!

00:18:54.930 --> 00:18:58.040
Thank goodness.
She's just unconscious.

00:19:02.220 --> 00:19:07.400
<i>I can't do it...</i>
<i>I can't do it... I can't...</i>

00:19:07.730 --> 00:19:09.310
This is it, Dark Schneider!

00:19:10.070 --> 00:19:11.940
I'll finish this
with the next spell.

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:17.520
In our condition, we've got only
one more attack spell left to use.

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:19.870
Give me everything you've got!

00:19:20.780 --> 00:19:24.280
If you don't beat me,
then next time, your woman...

00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:25.700
...will die!

00:19:27.850 --> 00:19:31.040
<i>I'm right... There IS</i>
<i>something wrong with her.</i>

00:19:32.070 --> 00:19:36.350
<i>I don't think she's really trying</i>
<i>to kill Dark Schneider at all.</i>

00:19:39.130 --> 00:19:44.300
I won't forgive anyone who
hurts her, Arshes. Not even you.

00:19:44.710 --> 00:19:46.890
Now let's do it!

00:19:53.780 --> 00:19:58.220
The cursed blue nail has turned
from purple to reddish-purple.

00:19:58.250 --> 00:20:00.860
Hurry up, Arshes Nei!

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:05.280
Once the nail turns crimson,
you will be destroyed!

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:11.180
Rip Dark Schneider's heart out and
use the blood to cancel the spell!

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:13.180
So that you can survive!

00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:15.870
Let's go, Dark Schneider!

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:19.580
This ultimate spell of destruction
will surely kill you this time!

00:20:19.610 --> 00:20:23.020
Fine! And I'll answer it with
the strongest spell in my arsenal!

00:20:25.390 --> 00:20:26.740
We have to hurry!

00:20:28.520 --> 00:20:29.740
Old woman!

00:20:29.770 --> 00:20:31.660
It's almost here!

00:20:31.690 --> 00:20:35.320
The realization of the vision
that appeared in my crystal ball!

00:20:35.350 --> 00:20:36.940
Wh- What did you say?!

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:46.460
What the?!

00:20:50.800 --> 00:20:54.930
This is... They're using their most
powerful spells against each other?!

00:20:55.030 --> 00:20:59.520
Are we too late?
The vision that appeared...

00:20:59.550 --> 00:21:03.530
...showed Dark Schneider lifeless,
with his heart ripped out.

00:21:03.560 --> 00:21:06.260
We already know how
this battle will end!

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:11.150
A storm is passing through.

00:21:25.290 --> 00:21:28.280
Kaizard, aruzard, kisku...

00:21:28.510 --> 00:21:30.360
Hansay glos silk...

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:33.480
What?! They're both
casting the same spell?!

00:21:36.220 --> 00:21:39.170
Unleash total destruction!
Sage of Hades!

00:21:39.200 --> 00:21:42.050
Use the seven keys
to open the gates of hell!

00:21:42.080 --> 00:21:43.460
HARROW...

00:21:43.510 --> 00:21:45.090
...ING

00:21:46.890 --> 00:21:50.040
<i>Farewell, Darsh...</i>
<i>I love you...</i>

00:22:10.020 --> 00:22:14.240
<i>Let me die quickly. Before</i>
<i>the spell transforms my body...</i>

00:22:15.910 --> 00:22:16.780
<i>Darsh!</i>

00:22:18.300 --> 00:22:23.960
<i>This is wrong... Because</i>
<i>she's cying... She's crying...</i>

00:22:25.710 --> 00:22:27.710
<i>Even if they aren't</i>
<i>really related, no parent...</i>

00:22:27.740 --> 00:22:29.530
<i>...and child should ever</i>
<i>try to kill each other!</i>

00:22:29.550 --> 00:22:32.190
<i>It just isn't right!</i>

00:22:32.380 --> 00:22:34.150
Stop it!

00:22:45.450 --> 00:22:49.820
The time approaches!
Look well, Great Priest!

00:22:52.100 --> 00:22:56.110
<i>If I'm to die, then I want you</i>
<i>to hold me one more time...</i>

00:22:56.580 --> 00:22:57.810
<i>Darsh!</i>

00:23:01.100 --> 00:23:02.790
<i>Dark Schneider!</i>

00:23:03.990 --> 00:23:05.770
<i>Who's calling to me?</i>

00:23:06.070 --> 00:23:10.700
<i>Open your eyes and look well</i>
<i>at your beloved daughter!</i>

00:23:11.440 --> 00:23:13.530
What?! You?!

00:23:15.290 --> 00:23:16.530
Rushe Ren Ren!

00:23:16.940 --> 00:23:23.310
Dark Schneider, don't you see
that Arshes' love for you...

00:23:23.340 --> 00:23:28.330
...has trapped her in a grief
that's even deeper than death?

00:23:29.170 --> 00:23:30.400
What are you saying?!

00:23:34.380 --> 00:23:35.190
What?!

00:23:36.100 --> 00:23:37.740
That's! Accused?!

00:23:38.220 --> 00:23:41.000
Amidst an agony
even worse than death...

00:23:41.030 --> 00:23:43.480
...rather than die by the curse...

00:23:43.510 --> 00:23:46.690
...Nei has chosen to die at the
hands of you, the one she loves!

00:23:48.040 --> 00:23:51.000
This is impossible! Did that
son of a bitch Abigail?!

00:23:51.480 --> 00:23:54.040
<i>Darsh, I love you...</i>

00:23:54.820 --> 00:23:56.220
<i>I love you...</i>

00:23:57.820 --> 00:24:02.160
He dared to do this to
my beloved daughter?!

00:24:36.900 --> 00:24:38.210
Darsh...

00:24:43.040 --> 00:24:48.620
Does it hurt, Arshe?
Then I will set you free.

00:25:30.360 --> 00:25:32.690
They cast the
ancient curse on Nei?

00:25:32.770 --> 00:25:36.030
Yes, and Dark Schneider's heart...

00:25:36.060 --> 00:25:40.070
...was the only thing
that could reverse it.

00:25:45.030 --> 00:25:46.190
Darsh!

00:25:54.610 --> 00:25:56.830
NO!!!

00:26:04.290 --> 00:26:08.020
And in the end,
the prophecy came to pass.

00:26:13.130 --> 00:26:14.540
<i>Rushe...</i>

00:26:18.970 --> 00:26:21.500
<i>Why, Rushe?</i>
